window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v26-019-f9b8d8193081a31b.json"]={sha256:"f9b8d8193081a31be967e8de7eef51a95a308001aa1754fa7259b46b170239f4",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-39ba997431535102","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6811.html","title":"RFC 6811: BGP Prefix Origin Validation","titleEn":"RFC 6811: BGP Prefix Origin Validation","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-019","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-019","related":[{"id":"security-v26-020","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8915.html","https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5905.html"],"title":"Network Time Security：可信時間與偏移誤差","titleEn":"Network Time Security: authenticated time and offset error","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：16與4只計最細層而非所有可授權長度總數；四類案例正確，報告明示未驗證完整AS路徑。 交付ROA/宣告對照表、兩種子前綴計數與遷移驗證紀錄。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Counts 16 and 4 cover only the finest level, not all lengths; classify all cases and explicitly state that full AS paths were not validated. Deliver ROA/announcement mappings, both subprefix counts and migration validation records.","difference":"畫出NTS-KE與後續NTP兩階段，區分cookie、認證結果與時鐘偏移；使用合成四時間戳，不修改正在使用的電腦時鐘。","differenceEn":"Diagram NTS-KE and later NTP exchanges, separating cookies, authentication and clock offset; use synthetic four-timestamp records without changing a working computer clock.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["一個/p前綴包含2^(q−p)個/q等長子前綴；允許更長maxLength會增加可被授權的更細前綴，並非增加AS路徑保護。 只分析一個教學/20前綴，maxLength=/24，origin固定；計算最細一層可表示的子前綴數。 2^(24−20)=16個/24；maxLength改/22後最細層為2^(22−20)=4個/22。","NTP偏移估計θ=((t2−t1)+(t3−t4))/2；認證能驗證對端，不能自動消除網路非對稱延遲。 四個合成時間戳以毫秒表示：t1=1000、t2=1018、t3=1022、t4=1028。 θ=(18−6)/2=6毫秒；若t4改1032，其餘不變，θ=(18−10)/2=4毫秒。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["A /p contains 2^(q−p) equal /q subprefixes; longer maxLength authorizes finer prefixes without adding AS-path protection. Analyze one teaching /20 with maxLength /24 and fixed origin; count subprefixes at the finest authorized level. 2^(24−20)=16 /24s; maxLength /22 gives 2^(22−20)=4 /22s at its finest level.","NTP offset estimate is θ=((t2−t1)+(t3−t4))/2; authentication validates the peer but does not eliminate asymmetric network delay. Four synthetic timestamps in milliseconds are t1=1000, t2=1018, t3=1022 and t4=1028. θ=(18−6)/2=6 ms; changing only t4 to 1032 gives θ=(18−10)/2=4 ms.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v26-029","referenceUrls":["https://docs.zeek.org/en/current/reference/logs/index.html"],"title":"Zeek：conn、DNS 與 TLS 日誌關聯","titleEn":"Zeek: correlating connection, DNS and TLS logs","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：16與4只計最細層而非所有可授權長度總數；四類案例正確，報告明示未驗證完整AS路徑。 交付ROA/宣告對照表、兩種子前綴計數與遷移驗證紀錄。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Counts 16 and 4 cover only the finest level, not all lengths; classify all cases and explicitly state that full AS paths were not validated. Deliver ROA/announcement mappings, both subprefix counts and migration validation records.","difference":"建立合成conn.log、dns.log與ssl.log三張表；先按uid連結同一連線，再用明示時間窗處理DNS名稱關係，不只靠IP猜測。","differenceEn":"Create synthetic conn.log, dns.log and ssl.log tables; first join connection records by uid, then relate DNS names within an explicit time window rather than guessing from IP alone.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["一個/p前綴包含2^(q−p)個/q等長子前綴；允許更長maxLength會增加可被授權的更細前綴，並非增加AS路徑保護。 只分析一個教學/20前綴，maxLength=/24，origin固定；計算最細一層可表示的子前綴數。 2^(24−20)=16個/24；maxLength改/22後最細層為2^(22−20)=4個/22。","可關聯率=具有必要共同鍵且可唯一連結的事件/總事件；共享IP與快取DNS會使名稱推論不唯一。 合成500個TLS事件中，420個有可唯一關聯的conn uid，80個缺失或重複。 420/500×100=84%；修正50個後470/500×100=94%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["A /p contains 2^(q−p) equal /q subprefixes; longer maxLength authorizes finer prefixes without adding AS-path protection. Analyze one teaching /20 with maxLength /24 and fixed origin; count subprefixes at the finest authorized level. 2^(24−20)=16 /24s; maxLength /22 gives 2^(22−20)=4 /22s at its finest level.","Joinability is events with required keys and a unique join divided by all events; shared IPs and cached DNS can make name inference ambiguous. Of 500 synthetic TLS events, 420 uniquely join to a connection uid and 80 are missing or duplicated. 420/500×100=84%; repairing 50 gives 470/500×100=94%.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-2144ce5d0b000796","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8915.html","title":"RFC 8915: Network Time Security","titleEn":"RFC 8915: Network Time Security","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-1a39d3e263dbfbc4","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5905.html","title":"RFC 5905: NTPv4 protocol and algorithms","titleEn":"RFC 5905: NTPv4 protocol and algorithms","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-0b3484edabc80964","url":"https://docs.zeek.org/en/current/reference/logs/index.html","title":"Zeek: Common Logs","titleEn":"Zeek: Common Logs","publisher":"Zeek Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
